                </div>
                <div class="timeline__content">
                  <strong>Residência Multiprofissional em Saúde do Adulto e do Idoso</strong>
                  <span>Hospital das Clínicas UFMG + Hospital Risoleta Tolentino Neves</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="timeline__item">
                <div class="timeline__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline__content">
                  <strong>Estágio em Alta Tecnologia</strong>
                  <span>Prosense — Belo Horizonte</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="timeline__item">
                <div class="timeline__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 000-7.78z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline__content">
                  <strong>Capacitação em Cuidados Paliativos</strong>
                  <span>Formação especializada em conforto e dignidade</span>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="timeline__item">
                <div class="timeline__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0118 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline__content">
                  <strong>Atendimento Domiciliar</strong>
                  <span>BH e região metropolitana — foco em adultos e idosos</span>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>

            <div class="credential-badge" role="note" aria-label="Informação de credencial profissional">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
              Registro profissional ativo no CRFa/MG (Conselho Regional de Fonoaudiologia)
            </div>
